  Depth: 0
  IsFolder: 0
  CreateFolder: 0
  Content: 'A decorated family of soldiers, generals, and security officers, whose
    lineage of brave warriors dates back hundreds of years.


    In the modern day, the Xiong family holds several high-profile positions within
    AEIOU. The previous Xiong matriarch, Athena Xiong, led the grand defense against
    Demon forces during the Awakening of the Evil Eye. After her tragic death during
    the operation, her oldest daughter Iris Xiong became the new matriarch at the
    young age of 10.'
